        "Alper Ferudun, A Negative Answer to the Strong Geography Question of Alfieri and Binns (30 September 2026), unrefereed AI-assisted computer-assisted preprint, version1.0; not Alec Kriebel authorship. The integral homology sphere Sigma(30,47,83), either orientation, has total ungraded F2[U] HF-minus torsion length16 and no length15 cyclic direct summand, answering the strong geography question negatively. This does not refute Lin's weaker restriction or the L-space conjecture. Existing DOI resolves; PDF, source/bibliography, exact1707-pair certificate, reproducibility code and outputs, and verification report are present. No new publication; no exhaustive-search/minimal-product, further-example, population-count or worldwide-priority certification. Credited source audit: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/1132 ; publication https://zenodo.org/records/23063072 ; https://eulersolve.org/papers/owr-14298580-008/"
